{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11307220","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11307220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130722001:1":{"text":"商隊が度々この辺でサンドクローに襲われてたから、いろんな物が道端に落ちたままになってる。","source_cn":"之前流沙之爪再这里抢劫了不少商队，有好多货物丢在路边没人管。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD809E13C868CA94C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130722002:1":{"text":"これから漁りに行ってくるよ。なにか使えるものがあるかもしれない。","source_cn":"我准备去翻翻，说不定还能找到一些有用的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF53B06AB18FCD93E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130722003:1":{"text":"少しでも金になれば、ウェイブに頼んで鹹水町で日用品や食糧を買ってきてもらえる。","source_cn":"要是能卖出去赚点钱，就让韦弗帮忙在咸水镇买些日用品和粮食。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1983C59C02F1973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130722004:1":{"text":"そうすれば、しばらくは生活に困ることもない。","source_cn":"这样的话，之后一段时间我就不用再为生活发愁了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA82BC2AE5EAE0DE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130722005:1":{"text":"その先の事はまだ考えてないよ。とにかく目の前の一日だ！","source_cn":"至于更远的事，我就没想过了。活一天算一天吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD88E771BD7D88461","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum